mintcam (0.2.6) noble; urgency=medium

  * Interface text: shorter and consistent labels. The record button reads
    "Registra" / "Ferma" instead of "Avvia registrazione" / "Ferma
    registrazione", the photo button reads "Scatta foto", and the streaming
    button "Avvia streaming".
  * Checkboxes are now in Italian throughout: "Scanner QR e codici a barre",
    "Aiuto messa a fuoco", "Inquadratura sul volto", "Sfondo sfocato",
    "Effetto specchio", "Time-lapse (foto in sequenza)". Several of them were
    in English while the rest of the interface is Italian.
  * The recording indicator reads "REC mm:ss" instead of "● REC mm:ss"; the
    dot is drawn by the stylesheet, so it is not part of the text any more.

 -- Alex Mirici <hilliedmikerano@gmail.com>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:20:00 +0200

